Homepage: http://www.freertos.org/FreeRTOS-simulator-for-Linux.html

Package: freertos-port-gcc-posix
Architecture: all
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, freertos
Description: Posix/Linux Simulator for FreeRTOS
 This is a port that allows FreeRTOS to act as a scheduler for
 pthreads within a process. It is designed to allow for development
 and testing of code in a Posix environment. It is considered a
 simulator because it will not keep real-time but it will retain the
 same deterministic task switching.
